{"server":"cn","storyId":"act30side_level_act30side_07_beg","groupId":"act30side","stageId":"act30side_07","title":"制动失灵","storyCode":"RS-7","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"a13de931337e9af7a8bdcf947497fdafec0107d41bf72589db5426b7ce9bca90","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g9_underkjerastastue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"侍女长，周围的人都已经疏散了，你怎么还留在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休露丝夫人才是，您不是应该已经回避了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你说回避我就要回避吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这座雕像可是所有人的心血，要是出了岔子，我要怎么和其他人交代？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是所有人的心血，还是恩希欧迪斯的心血？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......难怪刚才我就看到圣女大人把你按了回去，看来圣女大人对你说过一些什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人并不惊讶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我又不是傻子，圣女大人看起来毫不知情，但她怎么可能真的毫不知情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，以她的立场来说，知道，但又不知道，才是她最应该做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而她现在派你来捅破这层窗户纸，说吧，什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正在靠近这里的人，一个是锏，一个是维多利亚的“灰礼帽”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“灰礼帽”？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，他难道......不，应该不至于......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圣女大人是特意留你在这里给我提醒的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您就当作是这么一回事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雕像这边交给我就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g10_iceonlake"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到此为止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不愧是黑骑士，个人实力不容小觑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过如果只是这样，您应该清楚，您是对付不了我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不讨厌有自信的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我的耐心有限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你来回逃窜的样子，已经开始让我觉得有点无聊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很抱歉，女士。让您感到无聊是我的失职。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过，恕我直言，锏女士，您的招式中没有杀意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾经在卡西米尔所向披靡，以一把巨剑令对手闻风丧胆的黑骑士，如今却用着这样没有锋刃的武器——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种没有锋刃的武器对付你足够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用莱塔尼亚的巨剑比赛，是那些商人的诉求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，“用巨剑的莱塔尼亚武者”“用不了源石技艺的怪胎”......随便怎么说都行，无所谓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但好像时间久了，你们都忘了一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最开始我选择锏做武器的理由——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人的话被袭面而来的风雪堵回口中。\n袭向他的是谢拉格刺骨的寒风，是压面而至的无情山雪，是冰冷而重万钧的长锏。\n不容任何反抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这只是一个警告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来找恩希欧迪斯麻烦的人很多，如果每一个都能碾死了事，我的麻烦也会少很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，有些人活着比死去更有用处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就比如你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳......原来如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来还要多谢，锏女士手下留情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"锏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我用它的理由很简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它没有刃，用它，留你们这样的人一条命会变得轻松一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是这种没有利刃的武器，只要再多用一点力气，大部分人就会变成一摊肉泥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从以前开始，一直如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一些人称得上对手，大多数人却会被轻易碾碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管是莱塔尼亚的术师，还是卡西米尔的骑士，都没什么不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信念也好，理想也好，再高涨的情绪，再坚定的意志，在力量面前都不堪一击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太简单就坏掉也是一种困扰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"以锏为名的女人居高临下地俯视面前的维多利亚人，这并不是一个好对付的敌手，因此才会由她，也只能由她来出面应对。\n可即便如此，要击败对方也并不困难。\n以一介无法使用源石技艺的贫民为起点，到成为骑士竞赛蝉联三届冠军的黑骑士，这一路走来并不简单。\n可这之后的一切却又都太简单了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......与“天生的武者”黑骑士相比，大部分人确实都可以用“脆弱”来形容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别误会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你再认真一点，我也得费点心思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很遗憾，作为情报人员，我应该认真的地方，从来不是战斗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g9_underkjerastastue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，他们已经打到脚手架上去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个“灰礼帽”还真有点本事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在锏的手下从雪山一路逃窜到湖心岛，放眼整个谢拉格，应该没人能做得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而这样的人竟然在维多利亚还有许多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，这片大地真可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":true,"text":"是啊，这片大地真可怕，每天都要应付这些麻烦事，我好想找个人代替我当圣女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别想啦，圣女有今天的地位不也是你自找的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和你哥哥在这方面倒是挺像的，总是喜欢给自己找事做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":true,"text":"不许说我和他一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧好吧，那就他和你一样，行了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":true,"text":"雅儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":true,"text":"你还记得我们的约定吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？哪一个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":true,"text":"别装傻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，我当然记得，“耶拉冈德只需要看着祂的子民就足够了”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":true,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":true,"text":"当时的我已经有些作弊了......要是连这件事也要依赖祂，那我也好，他也好，我们的理想都只是一句空话罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......当旁观者要比你想的辛苦一些哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":true,"text":"那就只能请祂忍耐一下啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，虽然不知道祂能不能听到我们的约定就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正，我只是来看一看还能不能给这座雕像动动手脚而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":true,"text":"你果然没放弃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有这一点，我是绝对不会放弃的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇，锏刚才那一脚，我总觉得整座雕像好像歪了一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔，“灰礼帽”也不差，居然抓住雕像的手指调整身体的平衡，真不是盖的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们能不能帮我瘦个脸啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，最早的时候不懂事，觉得外表怎样都好，也就不太在乎自己的仪表。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"后来交流得多了，审美也就跟着人变了，才逐渐有了今天的样貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是，那些典籍里的画像一直存在，早知道从埃德怀斯家出去的时候，应该拿走那些有我画像的典籍的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谁知道这会儿他们忽然要给耶拉冈德建雕像啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇，一眨眼的工夫，这两个人就已经爬上雕像的顶部了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，对，那边的脸颊可以再削一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊呀，别把鬓角也削掉呀，那个我还挺喜欢的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......从这个角度看，好像还可以接受？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且，认识恩雅以后，反倒跟着她开始注意起自己的仪表了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"每次陪着她偷偷出去逛街，她都会推荐一堆可爱的小玩意，不知道什么时候开始，我自己也喜欢上这些东西了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对哦，刚才鬓角削掉的地方或许可以改成饰品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这个可以记一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇，“灰礼帽”好惨，想要从头顶跳下来，但是被锏一脚给踢飞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真可怜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g9_underkjerastastue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想，锏以前的对手，是不是就和“灰礼帽”现在的心情一样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明知道自己不是对手，但没有办法，总要挣扎一下，说不定有机会呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到最后发现自己果然还是没有机会。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些为了财富而站上战场的人，要比他更软弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"满意吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你看着我们给雕像修容好像挺开心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果满意吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，还不坏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去哪儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他那样死不了，早晚会回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还得去看着他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你确定你不会被他甩掉吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然正面过招他不是你的对手，但是他成心想要甩掉你恐怕也不是难事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，也不能保证他不是诱饵，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这些事，我会交给恩希欧迪斯判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希欧迪斯现在顾不上这边，这点你应该比我还清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交给我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确切地说，交给圣女大人吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雅儿晃了晃手中的通讯终端。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你都听到了吗，圣女大人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":true,"text":"交给我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":true,"text":"锏小姐辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"客气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":true,"text":"今晚的篝火晚会，你会来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"免了，我不太喜欢热闹的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":true,"text":"可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":true,"text":"要看住一个外国使节，一些外交手段比武力要更有效些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他可不算外国使节。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":true,"text":"他可以是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也好，那就麻烦圣女了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅儿","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这边可不是离开的方向哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g10_iceonlake"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的谢拉格人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔，该不会死了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的谢拉格人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别围着看了，先想办法把人捞上来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的谢拉格人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看装束，好像是外国人，这天气的水温，就是咱们本地人也不太扛得住啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问，发生什么事了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的谢拉格人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"刚才从湖心岛的方向忽然飞过来一个人，把冰面砸出了一个洞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！嘶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让一让，请让一让。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"哈洛德挤过人群，定睛一看，顿时哑然失笑。\n结冰的湖面被砸出一个美丽的圆形，而圆形的中央，漂浮着一具“死尸”。\n而他正是为了接应这具“死尸”来的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个水温，嘶——我这把身子骨可折腾不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问哪位有带棍子一类的东西吗？这是我的朋友，我来把他捞上来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的谢拉格人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啧，还真没有能用的工具，要不去问附近冰钓的乡亲借根钓竿来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，我有！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，太好——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，罗莎琳？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，大叔，又见面了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的武器借你，先救人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"围观的谢拉格人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们也来帮忙！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"借着罗莎琳的武器，在周围人的齐心协力之下，大家总算是把“死尸”给捞了上来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，看起来还没死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我不太愿意承认，不过他要是死了，那么事情可能就麻烦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，下手的人也理解这一点，所以才留手了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先把他搬到温暖的地方去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g6_lakescenery_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老板，借用一下烤炉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是约翰吗，他应该在山上啊，怎么会摔到这里来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山上？你遇到过他了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在山上遇到他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，没什么，只是说起来有点麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔你呢，你这两天干啥呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我原本就是代表维多利亚来祝贺耶拉冈德像落成的，而仪式就在明天，结束后我就该打道回府了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我就趁着最后的机会，到处走了走，给妻女买了点纪念品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔你还真闲啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年轻的时候总是想做更多的事，到了我这个岁数才知道，还是清闲一点好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，“尸体”活了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呕——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“约翰”，你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗莎琳小姐，还有子爵阁下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，我刚才都见到我死去的外祖父了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么成这样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就，说来话长了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您和您的父亲，相处得还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，就那样吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父亲？发生了什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”&烈夏","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就说来话长了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事，“约翰”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我不知道的情况下，你居然变得比我和罗莎琳还要好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"初雪","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终于找到你们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，圣女大人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圣女？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"初雪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"初雪","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，烈夏，你也在啊，那正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"初雪","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"子爵阁下应当记得，今晚会在银心湖边举办一场篝火晚会，作为明天落成仪式的预热。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"初雪","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说您最近四处游山玩水，怕您忘了，所以特意来提醒一二。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然记得，请放心，我一定到场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"初雪","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烈夏也一起来吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"篝火晚会？好啊，好啊，我一定到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"初雪","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位“灰礼帽”先生，我可以认为是您的朋友吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的，当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"初雪","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然是子爵阁下的朋友，那就是我谢拉格的客人，希望您也能赏脸参加这场晚会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......既然是圣女大人的邀请，岂有不从的道理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"初雪","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就......这么定了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
